    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>内容简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Six》中，安博林的登场真正击响了六王后间的战鼓。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“小三”“绿茶”“野心勃勃”“交际花”…甚至“女巫”</span></p><span></span><p><span>她身上仿佛贴满形容“坏女人”的标签。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个让亨八爱恨交加的女性真的有那么可恨吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期秋笈空前绝后的“超长巨献”，让我们一口气把安博林聊个够</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 博林，野心勃勃的新贵族</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 博林家的的另一个女儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1226">20:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 命运的邂逅与绿袖子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2497">41:37</a> 审判与变革，两个女人的焦灼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">41:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 她转瞬即逝的灿烂</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于秋笈散漫会：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>不经常在同一城市，但其实在不在同一城市都会看心情闲聊的两个人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎关注</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>"秋笈散漫会"微博&amp;哔哩哔哩&amp;小红书。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
